            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Simple Podcast Manager v1.14.0

- Replaces age-based Device Cleanup with an optional per-show limit of 3, 5, 10, or 20 episodes.
- Shows every suggested cleanup in the Sync review so you can keep individual episodes before syncing.
- Existing age-based cleanup settings are ignored and cleanup starts Off; choose a new episode limit in Settings to use it.
]]></description>
